Number 1
version 11.3
service timestamps debug uptime
service uimestamps log uptime
no service password-encryption
!
hostname Router1
!
interface e0
ip address 161.246.1.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
!
interface s0
ip address 161.246.2.1 255.255.255.0
no shutdown
!
router rip 
 !
no ip classless
!
procol rip
!
line con 0
line aux 0
line vty 0 4
&
